{"video_id": "VEAic3PrzHM", "segment_index": 12, "start_seconds": 33.040000915527344, "end_seconds": 34.040000915527344, "text": "Finalmente, el día me llegó.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "VEAic3PrzHM", "segment_index": 13, "start_seconds": 34.040000915527344, "end_seconds": 37.0, "text": "Estaba concentrado trabajando en la computadora y uno de mis hijos me dice,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "VEAic3PrzHM", "segment_index": 14, "start_seconds": 37.0, "end_seconds": 38.0, "text": "¿Papá?", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "VEAic3PrzHM", "segment_index": 15, "start_seconds": 38.0, "end_seconds": 39.0, "text": "¿Qué pasa?", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "VEAic3PrzHM", "segment_index": 16, "start_seconds": 39.0, "end_seconds": 40.0, "text": "Le dije mientras seguía enfocado en lo mío.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "VEAic3PrzHM", "segment_index": 17, "start_seconds": 40.0, "end_seconds": 41.0, "text": "¿Papá?", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "VEAic3PrzHM", "segment_index": 18, "start_seconds": 41.0, "end_seconds": 42.0, "text": "Escuchame.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "VEAic3PrzHM", "segment_index": 19, "start_seconds": 42.0, "end_seconds": 43.0, "text": "Te estoy escuchando.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "VEAic3PrzHM", "segment_index": 20, "start_seconds": 43.0, "end_seconds": 44.31999969482422, "text": "Y ahí me contestó, no, escuchame con los ojos.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "VEAic3PrzHM", "segment_index": 21, "start_seconds": 44.31999969482422, "end_seconds": 45.31999969482422, "text": "Me mató.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "VEAic3PrzHM", "segment_index": 22, "start_seconds": 45.31999969482422, "end_seconds": 47.119998931884766, "text": "Yo, a mi manera, era la mujer del bar.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
